      "units": [
        {
          "id": "dlm-primer-01",
          "slide": 1,
          "text": "Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager automates Amazon E B S snapshots. An E B S snapshot is a point-in-time backup of a disk. You can use it later to restore a new volume.",
          "text_sha256": "cb790957638f7a49dcef80f467aba76abfad3757a9a3af159fca97f1c2b2a40b",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "bddcb9f5f10b8b8b533778b2ad974389e6562fec725719e0aba160b4cac19659",
          "asset_sha256": "bb816b7e766dd6e290057b5aae4f9db7c0dfda43f4d28ae476844a8e3f1fc8e0"
        },
        {
          "id": "dlm-primer-02",
          "slide": 2,
          "text": "Say a store runs its inventory app from an E B S volume. Tag that volume Backup equals Daily. Set a snapshot policy to target volumes with that tag. Volumes without the tag are outside this policy.",
          "text_sha256": "ea9f3781b7805f20cade7d813342e3a54d1a3bf566cc4f36f55e13c3725d2a82",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "f7295ca1eb06508a92f9656b0cb6e360fe2eefd44abd701b56a65cfa1ffc0cc5",
          "asset_sha256": "bb816b7e766dd6e290057b5aae4f9db7c0dfda43f4d28ae476844a8e3f1fc8e0"
        },
        {
          "id": "dlm-primer-03",
          "slide": 3,
          "text": "Set the policy to take a snapshot every day and keep the latest three it creates. When a fourth snapshot is available, the policy removes the oldest one it manages.",
          "text_sha256": "08ee8704d05037202a28888d1e88af78376bc55c0d17a396ad9274d3862e1b97",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "08ee8704d05037202a28888d1e88af78376bc55c0d17a396ad9274d3862e1b97",
          "asset_sha256": "bb816b7e766dd6e290057b5aae4f9db7c0dfda43f4d28ae476844a8e3f1fc8e0"
        },
        {
          "id": "dlm-primer-04",
          "slide": 4,
          "text": "If the disk fails, choose a snapshot and restore a new volume. The policy keeps recovery points available. It does not test whether the application can recover, so practice that separately.",
          "text_sha256": "40557007950a05d625f158baf136aedc52a43c25a35d1f0076f397c61375f838",
          "canonical_text_sha256": "40557007950a05d625f158baf136aedc52a43c25a35d1f0076f397c61375f838",
          "asset_sha256": "bb816b7e766dd6e290057b5aae4f9db7c0dfda43f4d28ae476844a8e3f1fc8e0"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
